repository-code: https://github.com/Thuong180702/Wheeled-bipedal-robot-simulation
abstract: >-
  Controller, MuJoCo model, evaluation harnesses and raw result files for the
  Anchored Conditionally-Gated Controller (ACC): a hand-designed, fully
  interpretable torque assembly for a 10-DOF, 8.1 kg wheeled biped, whose
  central mechanism is a position integral confined to a 15 cm neighbourhood of
  the commanded home and enabled by an asymmetric envelope follower. Simulation
  only; no result has been validated on hardware.
keywords:
  - wheeled bipedal robot
  - balance control
  - push recovery
  - gain scheduling
  - MuJoCo
  - JAX
